@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-08  Transfer ownership or assign assessment owner
' Requirements: PERM-03 CONTENT-01 PATH-02 ASSESS-01 ACC-12 ACC-18 NOTICE-01
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Program Head" as H
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
actor "Previous owner" as O
actor "New faculty owner" as N
H -> S: Assign or transfer selected content to approved Faculty
alt Target is not an approved active Faculty member
  S --> H: Refuse transfer and retain current ownership
else Eligible new owner
  S --> H: Confirm new owner and preserve authorship history
  opt Previous owner exists
    S --> O: Notify transfer; remove former ownership permissions
  end
  S --> N: Notify assignment and provide owned-content access
  note over S
  Preserve revisions and student learning records.
  Course ownership includes only that course's results.
  Career-path ownership grants no extra student access.
  Initial shared-assessment assignment uses this flow.
  end note
end
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-08 | Product behavior
@enduml
